{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QuantumObservableUniverses.WeightDecomposition","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QuantumObservableUniverses.WeightDecomposition","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.CategoryTheory.Monoidal.Category","lean:module:Mathlib.CategoryTheory.Category.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.CategoryTheory.Preadditive.Basic"],"declarations":8,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.WeightDecomposition.proj_V_idem","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.WeightDecomposition.proj_V_idem","kind":"theorem","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/weight-decomposition.lean#L46-L46","doc":"Idempotency of vertical projection: `π_V ∘ π_V = π_V`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.WeightDecomposition.proj_H_idem","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.WeightDecomposition.proj_H_idem","kind":"theorem","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/weight-decomposition.lean#L44-L44","doc":"Idempotency of horizontal projection: `π_H ∘ π_H = π_H`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.WeightDecomposition.complementary","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.WeightDecomposition.complementary","kind":"theorem","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/weight-decomposition.lean#L42-L42","doc":"Complementarity: `π_H + π_V = id`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.WeightDecomposition.proj_V","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.WeightDecomposition.proj_V","kind":"def","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/weight-decomposition.lean#L40-L40","doc":"The vertical projection `π_V : Ω^k(A) → Ω^k(A)` (non-zero weight). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.WeightDecomposition.proj_H","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.WeightDecomposition.proj_H","kind":"def","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/weight-decomposition.lean#L38-L38","doc":"The horizontal projection `π_H : Ω^k(A) → Ω^k(A)` (weight-0). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.WeightDecomposition.forms","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.WeightDecomposition.forms","kind":"def","line":36,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/weight-decomposition.lean#L36-L36","doc":"The object of `k`-forms `Ω^k(A)` in `C`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.WeightDecomposition.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.WeightDecomposition.mk","kind":"ctor","line":33,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/weight-decomposition.lean#L33-L33","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.WeightDecomposition","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.WeightDecomposition","kind":"structure","line":22,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/weight-decomposition.lean#L22-L46","doc":"**Weight decomposition** of differential forms.\n\nGiven a torus action on `Ω^k(A)`, every form `α` decomposes uniquely\nas `α = α_H + α_V` where `α_H = π_H(α)` is the horizontal (weight-0)\ncomponent and `α_V = π_V(α)` is the vertical (non-zero weight) component.\n\nThe projections `π_H` and `π_V` are idempotent and complementary:\n`π_H + π_V = id`, `π_H ∘ π_H = π_H`, `π_V ∘ π_V = π_V`.\n\nLaTeX: `\\label{def:weight-decomposition}`\nRef: [lusztig1993] https://doi.org/10.1007/978-0-8176-4717-9 ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:weight-decomposition","label":"def:weight-decomposition","md":"quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/weight-decomposition.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}